_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZQZqJMVk8UQ7kNvwEK174B&_nc_oc=AdoOiI26BiqLWhXeUCk01blEjvte5CAxwm8qa-Fo0EJydBH_CcGeeN6BTFvCdr19-bA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQvLWjuL_JpZz5H0lFgLJ6L3l_Pax3lJ8ZXdyWqOJ8KNA&oe=6AFC6894"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d47JftXstE4Q7kNvwHaoj3l&_nc_oc=AdrBjMcvEQv6z2izXK8eP0ijth5X7583-DgyeCkPEl6abJ-agts04nxu_Y-QHZFWEy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTlSgcr-jRbZFJMwbI4-qzeG3c8l5txsIEREFGIw0zBQ&oe=6AFC7DD3"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Snap-fast pick-up-and-play: one scene, instant start.\n\n_Simple to learn, satisfying to master._", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-score board in this pick-up-and-play VR throwing game."}]}, "developer_name": "Little Forge Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": 